# ⚠️  SCRATCH probe from the May 2026 session — superseded by the September refresh.

Output data/demo/probe.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set Width 1280
Set Height 760
Set FontSize 16
Set Padding 18

Type "./data/demo/run-demo.sh"
Enter
Sleep 14s
Screenshot data/demo/probe-boot.png

Type "What did I spend in May 2026?"
Enter
Sleep 35s
Screenshot data/demo/probe-answer.png
